<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ADVISORY-Czech markets closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY-Czech markets closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech capital markets are closed on Monday as the country observes a public holiday, the day of the creation of a Czechoslovak state.</p>
<p>All markets will re-open on Tuesday at their reglarly scheduled times.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
